# Battle Arena Mobile Standards

- Keep Expo Router as the only navigation system.
- No browser-only APIs (`window`, `localStorage`, DOM CSS).
- All visible text uses i18n (`en/fr/pt-BR/it/es`).
- Persist language with AsyncStorage; seed from expo-localization.
- Phase 3 adds authentication, profiles, collection and game rules. Do not invent battle,
  multiplayer, ranking or evolution-execution features; they are flagged as planned by `GET /api/game/rules`.
- Auth tokens (Sanctum bearer) live ONLY in `expo-secure-store`. Never use AsyncStorage,
  `localStorage` or cookies for tokens.
- Do not claim emulator verification without actually running it.
